WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.587 --> 00:00:06.464
Slovenia

00:00:08.591 --> 00:00:10.635
where the forces of nature

00:00:10.635 --> 00:00:15.223
have crafted rich landscapes primed for adventure.

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:18.560
Snowy peaks,

00:00:20.895 --> 00:00:23.356
rolling hills,

00:00:23.398 --> 00:00:25.900
pristine rivers

00:00:26.443 --> 00:00:28.236
and steep cliffs

00:00:28.236 --> 00:00:30.822
invite us to play.

00:00:44.294 --> 00:00:46.629
In winter, these glacier carved

00:00:46.629 --> 00:00:49.299
limestone mountains lure the adventurous

00:00:49.966 --> 00:00:52.052
as they have for centuries.

00:00:56.765 --> 00:00:57.932
By summer,

00:00:57.932 --> 00:01:00.268
alpine ridges and meadows emerge.

00:01:07.776 --> 00:01:10.487
Leading us along high trails

00:01:12.697 --> 00:01:14.991
and through hidden valleys.

00:01:19.287 --> 00:01:20.622
Mineral rich rivers

00:01:20.622 --> 00:01:22.540
with challenging rapids

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:24.584
carve down through the topography.

00:01:34.511 --> 00:01:35.428
A landscape

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:37.430
filled with old growth forests,

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:40.058
covering the slopes of the green hills.

00:01:55.365 --> 00:01:58.284
High above, karst cliffs and caves

00:01:58.535 --> 00:01:59.744
call out to those

00:01:59.744 --> 00:02:01.579
who wish to brave the fight

00:02:01.579 --> 00:02:03.790
against gravity.

00:02:12.048 --> 00:02:13.424
Through the seasons,

00:02:13.424 --> 00:02:15.552
these forces continue to work,

00:02:16.469 --> 00:02:20.056
always shaping this unique outdoor playground.

